      m_Calls: []
  m_text: "> Does the game contain an options menu?\n> When changing the volume of
    sound effects is there a preview of the audio level (preview audio played with
    the audio system)?\n> Does the games options menu have an option to change the
    music volume?\n> When changing the volume of music is there a preview of the
    audio level (preview audio played with the audio system)?\n> Does all of the
    music in the game use the volume defined from the music volume setting\n> Does
    the games options menu have an option to change the sound effect volume?\n> Do
    all of the sound effects in the game use the volume defined from the sound effect
    volume setting?\n> Does the options menu save the user\u2019s configuration when
    the user exits the menu?\n> Does the game automatically load in the saved options
    when starting up?\n> When a volume setting is set at half is the volume audibly
    at half volume (unity can default to logarithmic scale rather than percentage)?"
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
